# Without this, `COPY . .` in the builder stage overwrites the container's
# Linux node_modules with the host's (macOS binaries, wrong Prisma engine), and
# pnpm's dependency-status check aborts the build with a stack trace that says
# nothing about the cause. Not optional.
node_modules
.next
.git
.env
.env.local
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
.DS_Store
README.md

# Local photographs are data, not build input. Without this a developer's uploads
# directory is baked into the image and then shadowed by the volume at runtime —
# wasted layers, and confusing the first time you go looking for a file.
uploads
